{"product_id":"juul-pods-multipack","title":"Juul Pods Multipack","description":"\u003cp\u003eIf you enjoy switching up your vaping flavors on a regular basis or you aren’t sure which flavor you really like and want to explore some options before committing to a pack of \u003cem\u003e\u003ca title=\"Juul pods Kenya\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/collections\/juul-kenya\"\u003eJUUL pods in Kenya\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e that features just one flavor, then JUUL Pod Multipack is a great choice for you. This package of JUUL pods features four of the most popular JUUL flavors, including classic Virginia Tobacco and refreshing Cool Mint. All pods are compatible with the JUUL device that comes with the Starter Kit, the Basic Kit, or the Silver Basic Kit Limited Edition. Just connect the pod flavor of your choice to your device and you’re ready to start enjoying truly remarkable flavor and the stratifying rush of nicotine.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso, buy \u003ca title=\"Juul basic kit\" href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-basic-kit\"\u003ejuul basic kit\u003c\/a\u003e and make a complete set of your juul.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Details of the JUUL Pod Multipack\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eA package of four premium-quality JUUL salt e-liquid pods in four unique flavors, including Virginia Tobacco and Cool Mint.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach pod is pre-filled with 0.7ml of JUULs e-liquid nicotine salt, which contains 5%\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eEach pod offers approximately 200 puffs\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e4 Pack Includes Crème Brulee and Mango Flavors\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePre-Filled Cartridges in 5% Multi Pack-\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003ca href=\"https:\/\/[YOUR DOMAIN]\/products\/juul-pods-virginia-tobacco\" title=\"Juul virginia tobacco pod\"\u003eVirginia Tobacco\u003c\/